[00:00.000] 作曲 : 照井順政
[00:01.000] 作词 : 照井順政/英译：Lynne Hobday
[00:02.000] 编曲 : 徳澤青弦
[00:30.528]A universe alive with sound
[00:35.581]A billion voices, a billion stars
[00:41.151]
[00:41.590]An ancient song, long forgotten
[00:46.781]Ringing out across eternity
[00:51.570]
[00:52.070]Longing to find a sense of freedom
[00:57.200]We ran like crazy from the start
[01:02.770]Perhaps we were both too alike
[01:06.112]Never saw the pain we caused
[01:12.634]
[01:15.306]Some may say we're being weak
[01:19.434]To fantasize and dream of what the future could be
[01:25.238]We've always held out hope to change this troubled world
[01:30.395]And each step of the way, we've laid the building blocks for tomorrow
[01:40.768]
[01:43.118]We crossed paths in this Universe, and it doesn't have to mean a thing
[01:53.773]But let me know you, let me reach out to you, you're my everything
[02:04.556]Another star burns to its core
[02:10.492]And falling, its orbit draws a storyboard
[02:16.098]This story shines upon someone far away from here, have no fear
[02:27.781]Oh, let us meet again somewhere far beyond the stars
[02:36.910]
[03:03.198]Funny how time has flown, we kept on going
[03:09.149]Seems we have traveled further than we knew
[03:13.804]Everyone we passed by is a part of our journey
[03:19.542]Right now, I can hear their voices too, it's true
[03:28.935]
[03:30.290]We crossed paths in this Universe, and it doesn't have to mean a thing
[03:40.830]But let me know you, let me reach out to you, you're my everything
[03:51.712]We're mere human souls
[03:55.406]And someday we'll vanish and fade into the amber glow of dawn
[04:03.575]So let us live for now, let us sing out loud and clear, have no fear
[04:14.949]Oh, we will meet again somewhere far beyond the stars
[04:24.945]
[04:26.879]Through it all you've been my one and only love
[04:33.145]Beyond the stars
